            "detailed_description": "The game presents levels where you advance on a traditional way from left to right, where we must advance defeating enemies, also there's 3d levels  were we must pass without raising suspicious and undetected <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are also levels were we ride our horse and we must pass trough the level or survive <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game will count with different possible endings, and 3 unlockable modes:<br />\r\n- &quot;Boss rush mode&quot;:with added timer for beating the bosses <br />\r\n-&quot;Alternative campaign&quot; :You can take control of an alternative character <br />\r\n- &quot;Infinity&quot;:Wich adds 3 additional stages to the campaign<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd don't forget to find all the hidden items in the game!",
