                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "All good except level three. This game was made to feels as a sega genesis game. The control are far for the common, shift to crouch, right click to slide, etc. Have levels similar as Aladdin's lava level but with horses. Story is plane and the level three have no sense, similar to hide game, but you cannot defend yourself, if someone saw you is Game Over. AI make random moves that make this level almost impossible to beat, also there are a bug at the end of the level three, you can enter to a gray area, despite the exit is near to you, you must take a few steps backwards then forward to finish it. For now I only completed the main campaing, there is something about gods, that I will look forward, however, I will not recommend this game to any hunter that is patienceless. In my story of hunting cheevos, I played worse game than this, my rate is not low, since can be fixed easily 3/10 (★★☆☆☆).",
